    <div class="steel-head">
      <h3>Stainless AISI 430</h3>
      <p class="steel-tag">The classic stainless character</p>
    </div>
    <div class="steel-grid">
      <div class="steel-text">
        <p>Most stainless handpans made in recent years are AISI 430 — and this is where that sound lives: <strong>long, shimmering sustain</strong>, far greater than nitrided shells, with the bright, lively response players associate with stainless instruments.</p>
        <p>Deep-drawn at 1&nbsp;mm, top and bottom, with the same even thickness as every Ayasa shell. For makers who want the wilder, airier stainless voice rather than Ember's controlled roundness.</p>
        <div class="shell-pair">
          <figure class="photo-tile">
